{"abstract":[{"text":"Move an existing player from one video to another without tearing it down.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/switchContent(to:_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" replaces the content playing in a live player. It","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps the player, the rendering surface, and the immersive space intact, which makes it the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"right call for “up next” rails, recommendation panels, and channel switching. Creating a new","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" per video would instead drop and rebuild the surface — on visionOS that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"means visibly leaving and re-entering the immersive space."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the player has not started anything yet, "},{"code":"switchContent(to:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" falls back to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/startStream(video:_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":", so it is safe to call as the single entry point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for playback.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Changing the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"player"}]},{"type":"text","text":" rather than the video — moving a session from an immersive space into a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"window, say — is the opposite trade and needs a new manager: see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Switching","anchor":"Switching","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"As with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startStream"},{"text":", pre-fetching the signaling file removes a network round trip from","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"inside the switch:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["func switchTo(video newVideo: Video) async {","    guard newVideo != currentVideo else { return }","","    do {","        let signaling = try await player.fetchSignalingFile(video: newVideo)","        try await player.switchContent(to: newVideo, signaling)","    } catch {","        loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch tears down the previous item, stops analytics tracking for it, resolves the new","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"item’s signaling, and starts the new stream. Analytics restart automatically for the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Reflecting-the-Transition-in-Your-UI","text":"Reflecting the Transition in Your UI"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isSwitchingContent","type":"reference"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for the duration of the call. Drive a"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"loading state from it, and disable the controls that would race the switch:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.isSwitchingContent","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] switching in","        self?.isSwitchingContent = switching","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"code":["Button(\"Play\") { … }","    .disabled(vm.isSwitchingContent)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Re-bind your player subscriptions around a switch rather than reusing them.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Which bindings apply depends on the content — a control room item exposes a camera selector","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and per-camera language sets that a flat item does not. Cancel your subscriptions, call","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switchContent"},{"type":"text","text":", then re-subscribe and re-read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reset your own transport state as part of the switch too: position, duration, subtitle cue,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"and the selected audio and subtitle languages all belong to the outgoing item."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Reacting to Playback Ending","anchor":"Reacting-to-Playback-Ending","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/itemDidEnd","type":"reference"},{"text":" publishes the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Video","type":"reference"},{"text":" that just finished. Use it to chain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"straight into the next item rather than dismissing the player:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.itemDidEnd","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] finished in","        guard let next = self?.nextUp(after: finished) else { return }","        Task { await self?.switchTo(video: next) }","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Handling Failures","anchor":"Handling-Failures"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/playbackError","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" reports errors that surface after playback has begun, as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"distinct from the error thrown by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"switchContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" call itself:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["player.playbackError","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] error in","        self?.loadFailure = error.localizedDescription","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Ads and Switching","anchor":"Ads-and-Switching"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A schedule set through ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/ads","isActive":true},{"text":" belongs to the content it was scheduled","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against and is cleared when the content changes. Schedule the new item’s breaks after the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"switch completes — see "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"title":"Switching Content"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/contentswitching"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"title":"Guides","generated":true,"anchor":"Guides"}],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/Drm":{"kind":"article","title":"FairPlay DRM","type":"topic","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Where encrypted content plays, where it cannot, and how the SDK decides which it is.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/drm"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/isSwitchingContent":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvrplayermanager\/isswitchingcontent","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","title":"isSwitchingContent","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/isSwitchingContent","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwitchingContent"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Combine19CurrentValueSubjectC"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Never","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5NeverO"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRPlayerManager/controlRoomSelectorViewModel()":{"type":"t